∇ main.cfg
[0] ⍝ Main entry point for the APL Data Transformation Engine
[1] cfg ← ⎕CSV ⍝ Load configuration file (CSV format: Parameter,Value,Type)
[2] ∷⍬ ⍝ Placeholder for actual file loading logic in pure APL
[3] LoadRules cfg
[4] LoadData 'data.csv'
[5] ValidateSchema
[6] ApplyTransformations
[7] NormalizeData
[8] SaveOutput 'output.csv'
[9] ∇

∇ LoadRules cfg
[0] ⍝ Parses configuration arrays and maps them to transformation functions
[1] ∷⍬ ⍝ Implementation loads rules into global namespace :global
[2] ∇

∇ LoadData file
[0] ⍝ Ingests raw dataset into memory
[1] ∷⍬ ⍝ Reads file, handles missing values, converts to numeric matrix
[2] ∇

∇ ValidateSchema
[0] ⍝ Ensures dataset meets expected dimensions and statistical bounds
[1] ∷⍬ ⍝ Checks ⍴data, ⎕DR data, and distribution properties
[2] ∇

∇ ApplyTransformations
[0] ⍝ Applies user-defined transformation rules to the dataset
[1] ∷⍬ ⍝ Iterates through rule arrays, applies vectorized ops
[2] ∇

∇ NormalizeData
[0] ⍝ Applies statistical normalization (Z-score, Min-Max, Robust)
[1] ∷⍬ ⍝ Calculates means/medians, divides by std/dev, scales to [0,1]
[2] ∇

∇ SaveOutput file
[0] ⍝ Serializes processed data back to disk
[1] ∷⍬ ⍝ Formats matrix, writes CSV, closes file
[2] ∇
